00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.060
WHICH I THINK WILL BE HELPFUL.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.490
AND THIS IS CERTAINLY A MUCH
NEEDED STEP,

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.580
BUT IT ALSO PUTS AN ALREADY
OVEREXPOSED,

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.440
AS YOU KNOW, FAIR PLAN AT

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.120
A SIGNIFICANT FINANCIAL RISK.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.250
IF THERE IS A MAJOR FIRE IN
CALIFORNIA.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.110
AND THAT'S WHERE WE COME IN WITH
THIS BILL,

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:17.740
OUR ATTEMPT,

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:21.370
OUR HOPE IS THAT THE MARKET
SEES THIS

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.770
AS A TOOL AVAILABLE TO THEM.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:24.850
THEY DON'T HAVE TO USE IT,

