UH, A PAYMENT HAS TO BE MADE,

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:40.090
UM, ON THE OBLIGATIONS THAT,

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.280
UH, OCCUR AS A RESULT OF,

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.850
OF OF, OF A OF A DISASTER SUCH
