00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:55.420
DECADES REALLY, AS OPPOSED TO

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.520
OVER THE COURSE OF DAYS, UM,

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.590
PAYMENT HAS TO BE MADE IN ORDER
TO COVER

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.140
THOSE RESPONSIBILITIES THAT ARE,

