AROUND THAT.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.839
THIS IS REALLY TO ADD AN
ADDITIONAL TOOL TO, AGAIN,

00:04:16.839 --> 00:04:19.900
HOPEFULLY CREATE A LITTLE BIT
MORE

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.360
OF CERTAINTY AND AN ATMOSPHERE,

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.860
AS I THINK WE'RE ALL TRYING
