00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.440
OF TRYING TO MAINTAIN THE MARKET
STRONG

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.210
INSURERS TO STAY IN THE STATE

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.790
AND PROVIDE AN OPTION THAT STILL

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.170
THERE WILL BE ACCOUNTABILITY.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:35.740
THERE WILL, UH, ON ALL ON THE
BACKS OF INSURERS.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:39.040
BUT THROUGH A VEHICLE, THIS TOOL
OF TRYING

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.110
TO AMORTIZE THOSE COSTS OVER
