STATE.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.860
AS YOU ALL KNOW, WHERE WILDFIRE
RISKS ARE HIGH

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.990
AND INSURANCE IS INCREASINGLY

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.000
UNAFFORDABLE AND ABSENT.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.490
MY DISTRICT SPECIFICALLY IS IN

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:12.900
A REGION THAT HAS EXPERIENCED

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:16.350
SOME OF THE WORST WILDFIRES IN
RECENT HISTORY,

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.990
AND I'M CONSTANTLY TALKING TO
FOLKS WHO ARE

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:21.300
DOING EVERYTHING THEY CAN WITH
THEIR

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.760
OWN MONEY TO PROTECT THEIR HOMES

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.429
AND COMMUNITIES FROM THE NEXT
DISASTER.

00:13:26.429 --> 00:13:28.650
THE SAFER FROM WILDFIRES PROGRAM
IS

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:31.290
THE ONLY AVENUE OPEN TO
CONSUMERS TO

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.630
RECEIVE DIRECT DISCOUNTS FOR
HARDENING

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:35.520
THEIR HOMES AND NEIGHBORHOODS.

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:38.700
THESE INSURANCE DISCOUNTS ARE
A GREAT INCENTIVE,

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:42.300
AND IT COSTS THE STATE NOTHING
TO OFFER IT.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:45.660
RIGHT NOW, THERE IS NO
REQUIREMENT FOR CDI

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:49.110
TO OPEN UP THE REGULATIONS FOR
EVALUATION.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.740
AS NEW AND SAFER BUILDING
MATERIALS COME TO MARKET

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.470
AND WILDFIRE PREVENTION METHODS
EVOLVE.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.870
