FROM

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.780
THE ORIGINAL PROPOSAL TO ALLOW

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:24.420
FOR ONGOING EFFORTS TO SHORE UP

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.520
THE INSURANCE MARKET TO FINISH,

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:31.230
AND FOR CDI TO CLEAR ITS CURRENT
APPROVAL BACKLOG.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.620
IN FACT, IN THE PREVIOUS VERSION
OF THIS BILL,

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.650
