CDI MUST CONSULT

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:44.520
WITH WHEN REVIEWING THE
REGULATIONS.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.620
WE HAVE ALSO WORKED TO ENSURE
THAT THERE

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:50.190
IS NO PROP 103 ISSUE WITH THIS
BILL.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.770
AGAIN, ALL THIS BILL DOES IS

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.440
REQUIRE CDI TO PERIODICALLY

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.840
CONSIDER WHETHER OR NOT THESE
REGULATIONS

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:00.690
NEED TO BE UPDATED TO REFLECT
THE FUTURE

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.090
NEEDS OF CONSUMERS AND THE
INDUSTRY.

