CONSUMERS

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.030
TO REDUCE THEIR WILDFIRE RISK.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.790
FOR THESE REASONS, WE ENCOURAGE
YOUR

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.859
